    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Fossil-specimen organ only: compact ovoid receptacle, restrained polygonal interseminal surface mosaic and short attached stalk. Original conservative three-dimensional thickness, beige fossil palette and nominal 0.1 m height; no whole parent plant, leaf whorl, daisy-like petals, inferred stamens, trunk-embedded structure or modern conifer scales. The mosaic expresses basic surface organization without claiming exact ovules, cellular anatomy or a specimen replica.",
      "zh": "仅化石保存器官：紧凑卵形承托体、克制的多边形间种鳞片镶嵌表面及短柄。保守三维厚度、米褐化石色与0.1米名义高度为原创美术设定；不添加整株、叶轮、雏菊状花瓣、推断雄蕊、干体嵌生结构或现代针叶树球果鳞片。镶嵌仅表达基本表面组织，不主张精确胚珠、细胞结构或标本复制。"
    },
